---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
description: Contact Psychiatric Health Solution by phone or email. Telehealth psychiatric care for all ages across Florida.
permalink: /contact/
---
{% from "pic.njk" import pic, banner %}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>We're here to help</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ site.visitNote }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
{{ banner('b-contact', 'A wooden dock reaching into calm Gulf water at sunrise as pelicans glide past', [800, 1200, 1600]) }}

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <article class="contact-card">
        <h2>Call</h2>
        {% set callPhone = (site.melissaPhone if site.showMelissa and site.melissaPhone else site.phone) %}<p><a class="big" href="tel:{{ callPhone | tel }}">{{ callPhone }}</a></p>
        <p>{% if site.showMelissa %}Answered any hour in English and Spanish. Leave a request or message and the care team will follow up.{% else %}Leave a message any time and the care team will call you back.{% endif %}</p>
      </article>
      <article class="contact-card">
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p><a class="big big-email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email | replace("@", "<wbr>@") | safe }}</a></p>
        <p>Best for general questions. Please don't include health details, medications or diagnoses in email.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="contact-card">
        <h2>Mailing address</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--plum)">{{ site.legalName }}<br>{{ site.street }}<br>{{ site.city }}, {{ site.state }} {{ site.zip }}</p>
        <p>All appointments are by video. Please don't visit the office without an arranged appointment.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    {% set addr = site.street + ", " + site.city + ", " + site.state + " " + site.zip %}
    <figure class="map-card">
      <iframe title="Map showing {{ site.legalName }} at {{ addr }}" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q={{ addr | urlencode }}&z=15&output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      <figcaption><span>{{ addr }}</span><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query={{ addr | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in Google Maps</a></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <div class="notice"><p><strong>In crisis?</strong> This practice doesn't provide emergency care. Call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a>, the Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline, any time. In an emergency, call <a href="tel:911">911</a> or go to the nearest emergency room.</p></div>
    <h2>Existing patients</h2>
    <p>For refills, rescheduling or questions for Ada, use your patient portal or booking platform, or call and leave a message with your name, date of birth and a callback number.</p>
  </div>
</section>
